<!--
  Merge these keys into ios/App/App/Info.plist after `npx cap add ios`.
  Only keys for capabilities the app actually uses are listed. Do not add
  NSUserTrackingUsageDescription: the app does not track and App Store Connect
  flags an empty tracking string.
-->
<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
<string>Cuidala uses Face ID to lock your home’s chores and restock list so only you can open them.</string>
<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
<string>Cuidala uses your location during setup to pick seasonal tasks and fetch a local forecast from Apple Weather. ZIP and climate stay on this iPhone.</string>
<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
<false/>
<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
<dict>
  <key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
  <false/>
</dict>
